; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_PriorityQueue.c	   176   *  \details         Os_PriorityQueueHeapDown restores the heap's shape property for a single node, if one of the node's
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_PriorityQueue.c	   177   *                   siblings has a higher priority.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_PriorityQueue.c	   178   *
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_PriorityQueue.c	   179   *  \param[in,out]   PriorityQueue The priority queue. Parameter must not be NULL.
