; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_PriorityQueue.c	   181   *
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_PriorityQueue.c	   182   *  \retval          OS_PRIORITYQUEUEPOSITION_UNCHANGED   If the node has not been moved.
